OL,3,GNEWSAMinister steps in after 6,000
OL,4,Ahomes ditched from plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has stepped in after an
OL,7,FEssex council removed almost 6,000
OL,8,Fhomes from its local plan.
OL,10,FIn September, Rochford District Council
OL,11,Fvoted to remove six major sites from
OL,12,Fits draft local plan which halved its
OL,13,Fpotential provision of homes from
OL,14,F11,783 to 5,897.
OL,16,FMatthew Pennycook, Minister for Housing
OL,17,Fand Planning, was not satisfied with
OL,18,Fthe reasons behind the council's
OL,19,Fdecision and has written a letter
OL,20,Fordering them to submit a local plan
OL,21,Ffor examination by 31 March 2027.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
