OL,3,GNEWSAMinister steps in after 6,000
OL,4,Ahomes ditched from plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdi Malviya, the Reform UK council
OL,7,Fleader, said many people in the
OL,8,Fdistrict "feel strongly" about the
OL,9,Flocal plan and the council was
OL,10,Fconsidering its response.
